### 1) Token yok -> [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")] nedeniyle 401 bekleniyor
GET http://localhost:5003/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### 2) Yeni bir Customer kaydı oluştur
POST http://localhost:5003/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer1@example.com",
  "password": "Customer123!",
  "fullName": "Test Customer",
  "streetAddress": "Test Street 1",
  "city": "Istanbul",
  "state": "Istanbul",
  "postalCode": "34000"
}

### 3) Customer olarak login ol, token'ı yakala
# @name customerLogin
POST http://localhost:5003/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer1@example.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### 4) Customer token'ıyla admin-only endpoint -> 403 bekleniyor (rol yetersiz)
GET http://localhost:5003/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 5) Seed edilmiş admin ile login ol, token'ı yakala
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:5003/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "<SeedAdmin:Password değerini user-secrets'ten al ve buraya yaz — commit etme>"
}

### 6) Admin token'ıyla admin-only endpoint -> 200 ve veri bekleniyor
GET http://localhost:5003/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 7) Token yok -> kategori oluşturma 401 bekleniyor
POST http://localhost:5003/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fiction",
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 8) Admin ile kategori oluştur, id'yi yakala
# @name createCategory
POST http://localhost:5003/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Fiction",
  "displayOrder": 1
}

### 9) Tüm kategorileri listele (herkese açık)
GET http://localhost:5003/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 10) Admin ile bu kategoride bir ürün oluştur, id'yi yakala
# @name createProduct
POST http://localhost:5003/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "9780743273565",
  "description": "A classic novel",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "listPrice": 15.99,
  "price": 9.99,
  "price50": 9.49,
  "price100": 8.99,
  "categoryId": {{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
}

### 11) Ürünleri sayfalı listele (herkese açık) -> Home.tsx'teki shape ile karşılaştır
GET http://localhost:5003/api/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 12) Kategoriye göre filtrelenmiş liste
GET http://localhost:5003/api/products?categoryId={{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 13) Id ile tek ürün getir
GET http://localhost:5003/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 14) Ürün arama
GET http://localhost:5003/api/products/search?term=Gatsby
Accept: application/json

### 15) Admin ile ürünü güncelle
PUT http://localhost:5003/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby (Updated)",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "isbn": "9780743273565",
  "description": "A classic novel - updated",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "listPrice": 15.99,
  "price": 9.99,
  "price50": 9.49,
  "price100": 8.99,
  "categoryId": {{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
}

### 16) Token yok -> sepet görüntüleme 401 bekleniyor
GET http://localhost:5003/api/cart
Accept: application/json

### 17) Customer token ile sepete ürün ekle (2 adet)
POST http://localhost:5003/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "productId": {{createProduct.response.body.$.id}},
  "quantity": 2
}

### 18) Aynı ürünü tekrar ekle (3 adet daha) -> aynı satırda quantity 5 olmalı, ikinci bir satır açılmamalı
POST http://localhost:5003/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "productId": {{createProduct.response.body.$.id}},
  "quantity": 3
}

### 19) Sepeti görüntüle -> tek CartItem, quantity 5, unitPrice = 9.99 (1-50 aralığı, "price")
GET http://localhost:5003/api/cart
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 20) Quantity'yi 60'a güncelle -> 51-100 aralığına geçmeli
PUT http://localhost:5003/api/cart/items/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "quantity": 60
}

### 21) Sepeti tekrar görüntüle -> unitPrice artık 9.49 (price50) olmalı
GET http://localhost:5003/api/cart
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 22) Ürünü sepetten sil
DELETE http://localhost:5003/api/cart/items/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 23) Sepeti tekrar görüntüle -> items boş, total 0 olmalı
GET http://localhost:5003/api/cart
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 24) Checkout denemesi için sepete tekrar ürün ekle
POST http://localhost:5003/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "productId": {{createProduct.response.body.$.id}},
  "quantity": 2
}

### 25) Checkout başlat -> response'taki checkoutUrl'i kopyalayıp tarayıcıda aç
# @name checkout
POST http://localhost:5003/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "shippingFullName": "Test Customer",
  "shippingPhoneNumber": "5551234567",
  "shippingStreet": "Test Street 1",
  "shippingCity": "Istanbul",
  "shippingState": "Istanbul",
  "shippingPostalCode": "34000"
}

### 26) Ödeme sonrası sepetin boşaldığını doğrula (webhook Paid yapıp ClearCart çağırdıysa)
GET http://localhost:5003/api/cart
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
